@startuml
title Game Dev Studio 游戏开发主流程（手动交接/不使用 autopilot）

start

:用户向商业策划下达指令;
note right
  代码位置:
  - src/components/CommandPanel.tsx:128-168 (sendCommand)
  - src/components/CommandPanel.tsx:504-509 (商业策划快捷指令)
  - server/index.ts:273-333 (/api/agents/:agentId/command)
  - server/db.ts:729-747 (createCommand)
end note

:Agent Manager 驱动 biz_designer 执行任务;
note right
  代码位置:
  - server/agent-manager.ts:362-445 (sendMessage, createStudioToolsServer)
  - server/agent-manager.ts:537-556 (query + mcpServers)
  - server/tools.ts:49-85 (createStudioToolsServer)
end note

:biz_designer 提交商业策划案 submit_proposal(type=biz_design);
note right
  代码位置:
  - server/agents.ts:325-335 (商业策划提交后等待审批约束)
  - server/tools.ts:359-404 (submit_proposal)
  - server/db.ts:531-568 (createProposal)
  - server/db.ts:1256-1275 (saveProposalToFile)
end note

:biz_designer 创建交接给 CEO(create_handoff);
note right
  代码位置:
  - server/tools.ts:72-79 (允许交接关系)
  - server/tools.ts:145-207 (create_handoff)
  - server/db.ts:821-866 (createHandoff)
  - server/index.ts:577-614 (/api/handoffs, pending)
end note

:管理者手动接收并确认 CEO 交接;
note right
  代码位置:
  - src/components/HandoffPanel.tsx:111-130 (accept/confirm)
  - src/components/HandoffPanel.tsx:392-410 (已接收后确认执行按钮)
  - server/index.ts:615-655 (/api/handoffs/:id/accept)
  - server/index.ts:656-684 (/api/handoffs/:id/confirm)
end note

:CEO 评审并提交评审结论 submit_proposal(type=ceo_review);
note right
  代码位置:
  - server/agents.ts:374-383 (CEO 提交评审并等待用户确认)
  - server/tools.ts:359-404 (submit_proposal)
  - server/db.ts:570-597 (updateProposal)
end note

:用户对提案做最终审批 (/api/proposals/:id/decide);
note right
  代码位置:
  - server/index.ts:996-1028 (/api/proposals/:id/decide)
  - server/db.ts:570-597 (updateProposal)
  - server/db.ts:1256-1275 (saveProposalToFile)
end note

if (用户审批通过?) then (通过)
  :CEO 创建交接给 architect;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - server/agents.ts:379-385 (CEO 交接目标约束)
    - server/tools.ts:72-79,145-207 (create_handoff)
  end note

  :管理者手动接收并确认 architect 交接;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - src/components/HandoffPanel.tsx:111-130,392-410
    - server/index.ts:615-684
  end note

  :architect 提交技术架构方案 submit_proposal(type=tech_arch);
  note right
    代码位置:
    - server/agents.ts:218-227 (架构方案先提审再交接)
    - server/tools.ts:359-404 (submit_proposal)
  end note

  :architect 创建交接给 engineer;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - server/agents.ts:223-229 (架构师交接目标)
    - server/tools.ts:72-79,145-207 (create_handoff)
  end note

  :管理者手动接收并确认 engineer 交接;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - src/components/HandoffPanel.tsx:111-130,392-410
    - server/index.ts:615-684
  end note

  :engineer 执行开发/测试看板流转;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - server/agents.ts:152-160 (开发/测试状态同步要求)
    - server/tools.ts:210-273 (split_dev_test_tasks)
    - server/tools.ts:275-357 (update_task_status)
  end note

  :engineer 调用 write_game_file MCP 工具写入游戏 HTML 文件;
  note right
    write_game_file 是 MCP 工具（由 SDK 本地执行）
    文件写入路径: output/{projectId}/games/latest/{path}
    代码位置:
    - server/tools.ts:new (write_game_file)
    - 区别于内置 Write 工具（需 CodeBuddy 运行时，CI 不可用）
  end note

  :engineer 提交游戏成品 submit_game (description);
  note right
    submit_game 完整执行链（8步）:
    1. 权限校验（仅 engineer）
    2. 检查 games/latest/ 目录存在
    3. execSync('zip -r ...') 打包 ← 需容器装 zip
    4. lintZipBuffer() → SonarQube scanner
    5. createFileStorageRecord() + uploadBuffer()
       → MinIO (需 ensureBucket 自动建 bucket)
    6. db.createGame() → SQLite 记录
    7. sseBroadcaster.broadcast('game_submitted')
    8. 返回成功消息
    代码位置:
    - server/tools.ts:540-743 (submit_game)
    - server/db.ts:661-707 (createGame)
    - server/file-storage.ts (MinIO 上传)
    - server/minio-client.ts (ensureBucket)
    - server/lint/index.ts:lintZipBuffer (ZIP lint)
    - Dockerfile.backend (apk add zip)
  end note

  stop
else (驳回/重审)
  :返回 biz_designer/相关角色修改提案后重新提交流程;
  note right
    代码位置:
    - server/index.ts:996-1028 (decide)
    - server/index.ts:348-378 (review)
    - server/tools.ts:359-404 (submit_proposal)
  end note
  stop
endif

@enduml
